OL,3,GNEWSANew addiction support for rough
OL,4,Asleepers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new NHS app has launched for people
OL,7,Fin Surrey who are rough sleeping or at
OL,8,Frisk of homelessness.
OL,10,FThe Rough Sleeping Service provides
OL,11,Fdedicated drug and alcohol addiction
OL,12,Fsupport by meeting people in the
OL,13,Fcommunity, rather than expecting
OL,14,Fattendance at appointments.
OL,16,FIt has been created by i-access,
OL,17,FSurrey's specialist drug and alcohol
OL,18,Fsupport service run by Surrey and
OL,19,FBorders Partnership NHS Foundation
OL,20,FTrust in partnership with alcohol and
OL,21,Fdrug charity, Via.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
